# the rendered artifacts of scripts/plot_cost_frontier.py; check them in
# so reviewers can see the frontier without running the script.
!reports/cost_frontier.md
!reports/cost_frontier.png
# Issue #951 — Phase 2 retrieval-eval (chunking ablation) timestamped runs.
# Aggregate artifacts (REPORT.md / specs / deltas / per-case raw scores)
# cross the commit boundary so reviewers can rerun --reaggregate against
# the same per-case scores. Raw scores carry no doc/chunk IDs or text —
# just qid + category + metric values, ADR 0005 boundary preserved.
!reports/retrieval/
reports/retrieval/*
!reports/retrieval/hybrid_sweep_summary.md
!reports/retrieval/hybrid_sweep_summary.aggregate.json
!reports/retrieval/phase2_chunking_*/
reports/retrieval/phase2_chunking_*/*
!reports/retrieval/phase2_chunking_*/REPORT.md
!reports/retrieval/phase2_chunking_*/chunking_specs.json
!reports/retrieval/phase2_chunking_*/deltas.json
!reports/retrieval/phase2_chunking_*/raw_results.json
# Issue #955 — Phase 3 retrieval-eval (mode ablation) timestamped runs.
# Same aggregate-only commit boundary as phase2_chunking_* above. No
# index build artifacts here — all 4 variants share data/index/real100.
!reports/retrieval/phase3_mode_*/
reports/retrieval/phase3_mode_*/*
!reports/retrieval/phase3_mode_*/REPORT.md
!reports/retrieval/phase3_mode_*/mode_specs.json
!reports/retrieval/phase3_mode_*/deltas.json
!reports/retrieval/phase3_mode_*/raw_results.json
# Phase 3.5 phase35_m3_* runs generated from the 898-chunk csv_text fallback
# are retired invalid private real100 artifacts. Future phase35_m3 reports must
# pass the tracked-artifact regression guard before any explicit allowlist is
# reintroduced.
reports/retrieval/phase35_m3_*/
# Private hybrid retrieval sweeps are local aggregate-only measurement outputs.
reports/retrieval/hybrid_sweep_*/
# Phase 4 retrieval-eval (metadata / filtering ablation) timestamped runs.
# Same aggregate-only commit boundary as phase3_mode_* above. All 4 variants
# share the kordoc 26k index; only plan['metadata_first'] / metadata_filters
# differ. Raw scores carry no doc/chunk text — qid + categories + metric
# values only, ADR 0005 boundary preserved.
!reports/retrieval/phase4_metadata_*/
reports/retrieval/phase4_metadata_*/*
!reports/retrieval/phase4_metadata_*/REPORT.md
!reports/retrieval/phase4_metadata_*/metadata_specs.json
!reports/retrieval/phase4_metadata_*/deltas.json
!reports/retrieval/phase4_metadata_*/raw_results.json
!reports/retrieval/phase4_metadata_*/COVERAGE.md
!reports/retrieval/phase4_metadata_*/coverage.json
# Phase 4 realistic query-time metadata routing (ADR 0065 decision #3).
# Same kordoc 26k index as the oracle ablation; metadata derived from query
# text via match_metadata_targets (no gold injected). Only the aggregate
# REPORT/deltas/specs are committable — qid + categories + metric values
# only, ADR 0005 boundary preserved. raw_results.json stays strictly-local:
# its per-case rows carry gold/extracted agency+project VALUES, i.e. the
# private corpus catalog from data/data_list.csv (a gitignored, pre-commit
# hard-blocked ADR 0005 input) — NOT committable. Regenerate locally via
# scripts/phase4_realistic_metadata_ablation.py.
!reports/retrieval/phase4_realistic_metadata_*/
reports/retrieval/phase4_realistic_metadata_*/*
!reports/retrieval/phase4_realistic_metadata_*/REPORT.md
!reports/retrieval/phase4_realistic_metadata_*/metadata_specs.json
!reports/retrieval/phase4_realistic_metadata_*/deltas.json
# data/index/real100_kordoc — hashing-backend kordoc 26k index (Phase 4
